      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KING.\nThere’s matter in these sighs. These profound heaves\nYou must translate; ’tis fit we understand them.\nWhere is your son?\n",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
